    <item>
      <title>Ulf Ten Aar</title>
      <link>https://mlemrecords.com/artists/ulf-ten-aar/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mlemrecords.com/artists/ulf-ten-aar/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ulf Ten Aar is het muziekproject van Robin van Ulft. Als cynische obersvator beweegt die zich door de dagen en bespaart hun medemensen van ondraagelijk klaagzang door de onuitputtelijke gedachten in muziek te verwerken.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ulf Ten Aar is the musical project by Robin van Ulft. As a cynical observer they bide their time and save their fellow human beings unbearable complaintive wailing by weaving these bottomless thoughts into their music.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Cage.Log</title>
      <link>https://mlemrecords.com/artists/cage.log/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mlemrecords.com/artists/cage.log/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Cage.Log is an indietronica project by Dylan Hokstam. Inspired by artists like MGMT and Boards of Canada. Cage.Log combines glitchy electronic sounds with an emotional indie sound which always brings the proverbial &amp;ldquo;me&amp;rdquo; into an emotional state.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
